{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c8f3e2d1-5a4b-4c3d-8e9f-merchantgateway2026",
    "name": "SilkPay Merchant Gateway API - Complete Suite",
    "description": "Comprehensive, 100% verified Postman collection for Merchants integrating with our Payment Gateway Aggregator Engine.\n\n### Authentication\nAll requests (except public auth) require your Merchant API Bearer Token in the `Authorization` header:\n`Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}`\n\n### Dynamic Variable Chaining\n- When you run `Create Payin Order`, the test script automatically captures `lastMerchantOrderNo` and `lastGatewayOrderNo` into collection variables.\n- Subsequent requests like `Check Payin Status` and `Submit UTR` automatically chain off the generated order number.\n\n### Automatic Callback Recovery\n- If an upstream webhook callback was missed or delayed by network issues, calling `Check Payin Status` automatically queries the upstream banking network live, settles your wallet ledger, and returns the real-time status immediately.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{apiToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4009",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiToken",
      "value": "gw_your_api_token_here",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "lastMerchantOrderNo",
      "value": "ORD-177000123",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "lastGatewayOrderNo",
      "value": "MPAYIN-20260804112000-A1B2",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "lastPayoutOrderNo",
      "value": "WD-177000456",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Payin (Collections)",
      "description": "Endpoints to create payment cashier links, check transaction status, submit customer UTRs, and query order history.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Payin Order",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const uniqueOrderNo = 'ORD-' + Date.now();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('lastMerchantOrderNo', uniqueOrderNo);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Order created successfully with cashierUrl', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(0);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('cashierUrl');",
                  "});",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.gatewayOrderNo) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('lastGatewayOrderNo', json.data.gatewayOrderNo);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"merchantOrderNo\": \"{{lastMerchantOrderNo}}\",\n  \"amount\": \"500.00\",\n  \"currency\": \"INR\",\n  \"payinName\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"payinPhone\": \"9876543210\",\n  \"payinEmail\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"notifyUrl\": \"https://yourdomain.com/api/payin-webhook\",\n  \"returnUrl\": \"https://yourdomain.com/payment-success\",\n  \"mark\": \"Order purchase test\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/merchant/api/payin/create",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["merchant", "api", "payin", "create"]
            },
            "description": "Generates a branded cashier payment URL. Direct your customer to `cashierUrl` to complete their UPI / QR payment."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK Example",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"merchantOrderNo\": \"ORD-177000123\",\n  \"amount\": \"500.00\",\n  \"currency\": \"INR\",\n  \"payinName\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"payinPhone\": \"9876543210\",\n  \"payinEmail\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"notifyUrl\": \"https://yourdomain.com/api/payin-webhook\",\n  \"returnUrl\": \"https://yourdomain.com/payment-success\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/merchant/api/payin/create",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["merchant", "api", "payin", "create"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": 0,\n  \"msg\": \"success\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"merchantOrderNo\": \"ORD-177000123\",\n    \"gatewayOrderNo\": \"MPAYIN-20260804112000-A1B2\",\n    \"cashierUrl\": \"http://localhost:4009/pay/MPAYIN-20260804112000-A1B2\",\n    \"amount\": 500,\n    \"payinState\": 1,\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-04T11:20:00.000Z\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Check Payin Status (POST Query)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Returns order status with isPaid flag', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(0);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('isPaid');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('status');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"orderNo\": \"{{lastMerchantOrderNo}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/merchant/api/payin/query",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["merchant", "api", "payin", "query"]
            },
            "description": "Check whether an order has been paid. Supports passing either your `merchantOrderNo` or the gateway `gatewayOrderNo`. If the upstream callback was missed or delayed, this endpoint automatically checks the upstream banking network, updates the database, settles your wallet ledger, and returns the real-time status."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK Example (Status: Paid)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"orderNo\": \"ORD-177000123\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/merchant/api/payin/query",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["merchant", "api", "payin", "query"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": 0,\n  \"msg\": \"success\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"isPaid\": true,\n    \"status\": \"PAID\",\n    \"payinState\": 2,\n    \"payinStateName\": \"Success\",\n    \"orderNo\": \"ORD-177000123\",\n    \"merchantOrderNo\": \"ORD-177000123\",\n    \"gatewayOrderNo\": \"MPAYIN-20260910120000-A1B2\",\n    \"amount\": \"500.00\",\n    \"actualAmount\": \"500.00\",\n    \"feeCharged\": \"20.00\",\n    \"settleAmount\": \"480.00\",\n    \"currency\": \"INR\",\n    \"utr\": \"428712345678\",\n    \"cashierUrl\": \"http://localhost:4009/pay/MPAYIN-20260910120000-A1B2\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-10T11:20:00.000Z\",\n    \"paidAt\": \"2026-09-10T11:21:45.000Z\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
